From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Date: Sun, 8 Nov 2026 06:06:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] dt-bindings: dma: apple,sio: describe the T8132 SIO

Add apple,t8132-sio. Its node has both SIO register windows, and remains
disabled until its channel layout and firmware handoff are supported, so
that no channel count is guessed. Keep the channel-count requirement for the
earlier layouts.

(backported from commit 6de4b8e4a92ae4a0394879a32790d0c49a4586df)
[j604: binding part only, on this tree's binding (no T6041 entry, no
 SoC-specific protocol text). Without the T8132 clocks: this tree has no
 provider for them (upstream describes a disabled stub). H3-D4 of ports-3
 round 2.]
Signed-off-by: Dylan Ironside <dylan@dylanironside.io>
Assisted-by: Claude:claude-opus-5.5
---
 .../devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml    | 33 +++++++++++++++++--
 1 file changed, 31 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml
index dbaaa2d3d1..5ac7c88cd4 100644
--- a/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml
+++ b/Documentation/devicetree/bindings/dma/apple,sio.yaml
@@ -10,12 +10,36 @@ description:
   SIO is a coprocessor on Apple M1 and later chips (and maybe also on earlier
   chips). Its role is to offload SPI, UART and DisplayPort audio transfers,
   being a pretend DMA controller.
+  The T8132 resource description remains disabled until its channel layout
+  and firmware handoff are supported; its channel count is not guessed.
 
 maintainers:
   - Martin Povišer <povik+lin@cutebit.org>
 
 allOf:
   - $ref: dma-controller.yaml#
+  - if:
+      properties:
+        compatible:
+          contains:
+            const: apple,t8132-sio
+      required:
+        - compatible
+    then:
+      properties:
+        reg:
+          minItems: 2
+          maxItems: 2
+        status:
+          const: disabled
+      required:
+        - status
+    else:
+      properties:
+        reg:
+          maxItems: 1
+      required:
+        - dma-channels
 
 properties:
   compatible:
@@ -24,10 +48,16 @@ properties:
           - apple,t6000-sio
           - apple,t6030-sio
           - apple,t8103-sio
+          - apple,t8132-sio
       - const: apple,sio
 
   reg:
-    maxItems: 1
+    minItems: 1
+    maxItems: 2
+    description:
+      Coprocessor register window, followed by an auxiliary window on T8132.
+
+  status: true
 
   '#dma-cells':
     const: 1
@@ -87,7 +117,6 @@ required:
   - compatible
   - reg
   - '#dma-cells'
-  - dma-channels
   - mboxes
   - iommus
   - power-domains
